Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 11:47:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 31/39] IbashoAgent setProfile and setDisplayName

The agent sets its own profile and display name, as the profile and
display name windows do:

- setProfile: the about text and/or the picture, each a PUT to the
  AgentProfile capability; grids without it (OpenSim) get the older
  AvatarPropertiesUpdate message, made from the current profile with only
  the fields given changed.
- setDisplayName: LLViewerDisplayName::set, answered when the region's
  reply comes; too soon after the last change (Second Life allows about one
  a week) says when the next can be made, and so does profile for myself
  (display_name_next_change).
---
